# FLIXO Manual-Only Product Directive

FLIXO production exposes direct manual browser tools only.

- No public or internal AI agent runtime.
- No agent gateway, specialist router, autonomous planner, agent memory, or agent execution loop.
- User actions are initiated explicitly from tool pages.
- Supported local tool chains execute only through direct browser-local adapters.
- Raw files remain browser-local unless a specific standalone tool explicitly documents a remote dependency.
- `src/config/registry.ts` remains the canonical tool registry.
